  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x11" flags="0x0">
    <title>EXCV :: Motor drive voltage-comp map B (duty x battery V)</title>
    <description>CURATED (code-proven): EXCV H-bridge drive voltage-compensation, bank B (other H-bridge side). Same axes/role as map A. Previously mislabeled 'Fuel :: Secondary Trim'; stock cells near-neutral (0x80). PORTED FROM HAYABUSA 5JCZSJ10 (HIGH: breakpoints byte-identical, almost certainly the same map). Units/scaling carried over; GSX-R addresses andamp; values are this read's own. Hayabusa code refs are not verified on GSX-R. X: 23 pts 14680..59963 raw; Y: 9 pts 0..255 raw GSX-R TR</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="1" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x1587F0" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedcolcount="23" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
