    <title>EXCV :: Target position - CLOSED (raw 0-1023)</title>
    <description>CURATED (code-proven): Exhaust Control Valve closed-position setpoint. The EXCV demand (0xFEBF62BE) is driven to this value when closed; scale matches the position-sensor feedback 0xFEF025DA (ADC ch 0x33). State-machine control (FUN_0007899C family), not an RPM curve. Stock 204. Stock 204 (u16 0..65535).</description>
